  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring and Evaluation of Scaling Access and Learning in Education (SCALE) Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Monitoring and Evaluation of Scaling Access and Learning in Education (SCALE) Programme MEL (SCALE MEL) programme is a component of SCALE which aims to improve the effectiveness of education financing in low and lower-middle income countries. The SCALE MEL programme provides services in both monitoring and evaluation of the SCALE programme to help build a strong evidence base for programme learning and accountability and assess the extent to which the design and implementation of the SCALE programme supports FCDO&#x2019;s normative Pathway for Scaling Learning Outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
